{"id":"vod_sn_37747","vodId":"37747","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"拉格纳强袭天使","name_cn":"拉格纳强袭天使","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/eb453b45ad544a1eaf513787c1d34449.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《RAGNA STRIKE ANGELS》改编自同名手机游戏，由庄司龙也DINGO・Aniplex Mobile企划，深崎暮人担当角色原案的一部游戏，并有动画等衍生作品。动画时长为每话30秒。“可以喔，我会变大给你看的”。E.R.2035年，突然出现的巨大生命体“费亚雷姆”。人类大量投入了战斗型智能机器人“艾克提斯”以与之对抗，但在身长超过50m的费亚雷姆那压倒性的力量面前仍处于无可否认的劣势。为了解决事态，国家议会将利用细胞成长因子CGF-3使生物肥大化的技术应用到军事上，将人类当做巨大兵器投入到实战当中，下达了这样的决断。作为对费亚雷姆特化部队“Ragna Strikers”，而被拔擢的6位巨大化适合者女主角。少女们相信着与特务官的牵绊，向强大的敌人挑战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5vBdD1xP0x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/75YheaFGUG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aQyreuHFQ31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WC31xQzjMx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gfCCWiYJ4k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gM9bnck8PR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iw26UCyGg71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hus0Gc9LiK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xTnqT01CcY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iELNDrhpCx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9JPJsVPTGv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uJje1aeN4g1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:07.129Z"}